</div>
<p class="bench-note">The protocol engine alone, with no sockets, handles 11,300,050 inbound messages a second, and adds an entry to a sparse import table in 35.5 ns.</p>
```

# [Per-connection footprint]($section.id('per-connection-footprint'))

`bench-peer-scaling` counts inline and heap memory in each state: idle
(accepted, no message yet), warmed (one export and one delivered message),
sixteen live exports, and served with a vat. The half-million column
is arithmetic over core memory, not RSS or a live network test.

